Z||000001||RICK||10-11-1999||10:36 PM||||Sounds like your heater core has a small leak.  Do a search in the forum for "Heater Core", there's some good suggestions out there on how to fix it and how to get that smell out.  Good Luck!||||reg||14
Z||000002||DXR_DAD||10-11-1999||11:31 PM||||Ya, Rick sounds like the H/C Not that big of a job to r&r. Your local parts house should have it in stock, do check around I replaced mine and got 30-60$ in price. I did by-pass the H/C for a day or two, no heat but it was ok. The big plastic box under the passanger side dash...thats it.<P>QUICK FIX&gt; Buy a new one!!!||||reg||1
